Feature: Petstore API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a POST request with the following payload\n      | id    | 12345 |\n      | name  | \"Doggie\" |\n      | status| \"available\" |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the pet details\n\n  Scenario: Get pet details\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/12345\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the pet details\n\n  Scenario: Update pet details\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a PUT request with the following payload\n      | id    | 12345 |\n      | name  | \"DoggieUpdated\" |\n      | status| \"sold\" |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the updated pet details\n\n  Scenario: Delete a pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/12345\"\n    When I send a DELETE request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet should be deleted